   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**How to read:** tiles show the latest value with its trend; colours follow thresholds (green = healthy, orange = watch, red = act). Hover the (i) icon on a tile for its definition. Spec metrics: **Table Row Count** (`SELECT COUNT(*)`), **Storage Footprint MB** (`pg_total_relation_size` / `os.path.getsize`), **Date Coverage Span** (distinct year-months vs expected). Snapshots are taken after every transform."
   },
   "transparent": true
  },
